chapter.v:
Remember Jesus 


Christ, risen, 


from the dead, the offspring of David, as preached in my gospel,

The saying 


is trustworthy,, 


for: If we have died with him, we will also live with him;

if we 


endure, we, 


will also reign with him; if we deny him, he also will deny us;

But avoid 


irreverent babble,, 


for it will lead people into more and more ungodliness,
